# A list element the list need not have.
-- source.cue --
l: [...int]
-- target.cue --
f: int
-- lens.cue --
v0_0: _
v1_0: {f: v0_0.l[0]}
-- out --
not total
v1_0.f copies v0_0.l[0], which may be absent: v0_0.l[0] is an element the list need not have (its length is uint); write the field under if v0_0.l[0] != _|_ (rule source-absent) @ lens.cue:2:11
